  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Savannah Integrated Biodiversity Conservation Initiative (SIBCI) - Grant for Mole National Parc inPAPBio program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Overall objective: To contribute to promoting endogenous, sustainable and inclusive economic development that responds to the challenges of climate change. Specific objective: To achieve a more sustainable, participatory and integrated management of the Mole National Park(MNP) towards biodiversity conservation and resilience to climate change.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
